  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What Went Wrong",
      "items": [
        "A 260 ms pause sits in the middle of one sentence; stop_secs was 0.2 s",
        "The endpointer fired inside the pause and Whisper transcribed a fragment",
        "Every run of this configuration made 2.00 LLM calls instead of 1.00"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What It Cost",
      "items": [
        "A complete 605 ms generation was produced, then discarded",
        "TTS started and was cancelled 2.5 ms later, so nothing reached the speaker",
        "2371 ms end to end, against 1730 ms for the same fixture at stop_secs 0.5 s"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "How To Read This",
      "items": [
        "Timings are span boundaries from one real recorded run, not a reconstruction",
        "Input was synthetic speech with clean endpoints, which is the easy case",
        "Human speech carries breath and hesitation, and endpoints there are harder"
      ]
    }
  ]
